<title>UK: Soc Gen adds $30 million to perpetual bond. [CORRECTED 11:12 GMT]</title>
<headline>Soc Gen adds $30 million to perpetual bond. [CORRECTED 11:12 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE GENERALE</p>
<p> AMT    *$250 MLN     BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  PERPETUAL</p>
<p> (Corrects base from &quot;6M-LIBOR).</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +62.5 BP  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.74     FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 30.SEP.96 FOR $220 MILLION</p>
<p>		ALL OTHER TERMS REMAIN THE SAME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
